docs {
  # EventHub API Collection

  ## Before your first request

  Select environment **local** in the top-right dropdown (not "No Environment").
  Editing variables in the Environments tab does NOT activate them — you must select **local** in the dropdown.

  ## Flow

  1. Select **local** environment (top right)
  2. Run **Auth > Register** (first time only)
  3. Run **Auth > Login** — saves `token` automatically
  4. Use **Events** and **Registrations** requests

  Default `baseUrl`: http://localhost:8080
}
